template: Archotechs are the gods we were always waiting for. The archotechs have no interest in judging us one by one. They await a single people who can demonstrate our worthiness by acting morally as one. Some day, the archotechs will depart. They will bring a select few humans with them, and leave the rest behind to suffer.
